# 🐍 Snakeeyes Simkl Addon for Stremio

[![Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/version-2.1.0-blue.svg)](https://github.com/ta9446955-cpu/https-stremiotrakt.addon)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)
[![Stremio](https://img.shields.io/badge/Stremio-Addon-orange.svg)](https://www.stremio.com/)

> **Your Simkl profile + curated TMDB catalogs, all in Stremio.**

## 📖 Description

**Snakeeyes Simkl** is a Stremio addon that integrates with **Simkl** to bring your personal watch history, watchlist, and ratings directly into Stremio. It also provides a rich set of curated catalogs from **TMDB** (The Movie Database), including award-winning films, genre collections, director filmographies, actor filmographies, and popular movie franchises.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🎯 Personal Simkl Integration
- 📺 **Watch History** (Movies & Series) — Track what you've watched
- 📋 **Watchlist** (Movies & Series) — Your saved "to-watch" items
- ⭐ **Ratings** (Movies & Series) — All your rated content

